|| ^ Changelog ^ ||

Most recent release:

2.4.3-beta
    * Revert joint speeds to reduce bounciness

2.4.2-beta
    * Fixed commands not accepting +
    * Changed StepSpeed and CrouchSpeed to %

2.4.1-beta
    * Fixed Standing Width invertion errors

2.4.0-beta
    * Added TurnOffsets
    * Added vtol offset and speed configurations
    * Added TorsoLegAlignment
    * Added independentstep command
    * Added per-joint configurations
    * Added per-joint influence for leg joints
    * Added poses (animations)
    * Added PrecisionLocking
    * Added hip tilt & HipBalancing option
    * Added HeightBalancing option
    * Added CameraGravity option
    * Added HipBalancing option
    * Added HeightBalancing option
    * Added SyncStep
    * Added AI+ ai flight movement block as stabilization support
    * Moved TorsoTwistSensitivity to per-joint configuration
    * Changed that thrusters now act the same as in VTOL mode
    * Changed Prismatic default StandingHeight 90% -> 70%
    * Fixed Prismatic pistons not getting configuration
    * Fixed turn/strafe joint inconsistencies across leg group types

2.3.1-beta
    * Fix digitigrade joints (line up w/ humanoid)
    * Fix autotype/autoname breaking with block fetching changes

2.3.0-beta
    * Make walk command idempotent
    * Add strafe command
    * Allow individual toggling of legs & arms
    * Upgrade vtol system
    * Tinker with stabilization (part 3)
    * StrafeWidth/StrafeDistance -> StrafeLength
    * Remove ShowStats (a part of debug mode now)

2.2.2-beta
    * Fix camera gravity requirements

...

